ada</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamate</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Two cases of torsion of the gallbladder diagnosed preoperatively</article-title><source>J Paediatr Surg</source><year>1997</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>1567</fpage><lpage>1569</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9396527</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0022-3468(97)90454-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shaik</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Charles</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Domingo</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaub</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gallbladder volvulus: report of two original cases and review of the literature</article-title><source>Am Surg</source><year>2005</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>87</fpage><lpage>89</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15757065</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lau</surname><given-names>WY</given-names></name><name><surname>Fan</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name><name><surname>Wong</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute torsion of the gallbladder in the aged: a re-emphasis on clinical diagnosis</article-title><source>Aust N Z J Surg</source><year>1982</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>492</fpage><lpage>494</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6959595</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1445-2197.1982.tb06036.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reddy</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name><name><surname>Muralidharam</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Venkatasubramaniam</surname